 <h3><u>Shehr e sarwar</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Shehr E SARWAR AS ki aabo hawa or hai. - 6<br> Jannaten or hain karbala or hai.-2<br> Shehr E SARWAR AS ki aabo hawa or hai. -2</p> 
  <p>1) Mai hun beemar jane de karbobala - 4<br> Ay tabeeb is maraz ki dawa or hai.<br> Shehr E SARWAR AS...</p> 
  <p>2) Dusra koi SHABBIR AS kaise mile-4<br> Kya KHUDA k alawa KHUDA or hai.<br> Shehr E SARWAR AS..</p> 
  <p>3) Sath phoolo'n k sar bhi chadhao yahan - 3<br> Maqbare or hain Taziya or hai.<br> Shehr E SARWAR - 2</p> 
  <p>4) Ay mufassir bata kya tamasha hai ye-3<br> Aayaten or hain tarjuma or hai.<br> Shehr E SARWAR - 3</p> 
  <p>5) Dusro'n se ALI AS ka taqabul hi kya - 3<br> Hadse or hai mojza or hai.<br> Shehr E SARWAR AS - 3</p> 
  <p>6) hans k deewar - 3<br> Hans k dewar E kabah ye Kehne lagi - 3<br> UMME HAIDER AS tera rasta or hai.<br> Shehr E SARWAR AS - 3</p> 
  <p>7) Boli Mariyam taqabul na karna mera - 4<br> KIBRIYA ki qasam FATEMA SA or hain.<br> Shehr E SARWAR AS - 3</p> 
  <p>8) Airo ghairo ki midhat mai karta nahi - 2<br> Main Hu Nayab meri ana or hai<br> Shehr E SARWAR AS ki aabo hawa or hai - 2</p> 
